Abstract = {This paper presents insights into the topic of Insights into Indoor
   Navigation. Floor detection based on Sensor fusion is investigated in
   order to gather a better understanding of combining different
   measurement techniques to achieve a better measured result. Methods of
   crowd counting and their various advantages and disadvantages are
   investigated. A proposed solution called ` UrbanCount', is studied and
   compared against traditional solutions. Multi-sensor fusion based fault
   detection is explored and its benefits and drawbacks are discussed.
   Holography of Wi-fi Radiation and See Through Walls using WiFi touched
